# HustlePilot AI — Environment Configuration
# Copy this file to .env and fill in values if needed.
# Currently, HustlePilot AI does NOT require any environment variables for
# its default local-first workflow.

# If you want to pre-configure the Ollama endpoint at build time, uncomment:
# VITE_OLLAMA_URL=http://localhost:11434
# VITE_OLLAMA_MODEL=llama3.2

# IMPORTANT: Never put API keys, private tokens, or secrets in this file
# if it will be committed. The .env file is excluded from version control.
